   },
   "message": "README: honest kernel line \u2014 planting snapshot, not current-grail parity [M9]\n\nThe README claimed the kernel is \"v0.6.0 (byte-identical to the grail at\nkody-w/rapp-installer)\". That parity no longer holds \u2014 the grail advanced to\nbrainstem-v0.6.9. heimdall is a planted seed (its kernel is the snapshot it was\nplanted with), not the RAPP reference distro that tracks the grail. Reworded to\nbe honest about the snapshot without claiming false live parity:\n\n  v0.6.0 (grail snapshot at planting \u2014 the live grail may be newer;\n          see kody-w/rapp-installer)\n\nRefs kody-w/RAPP#83\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
